    "\n\n（%@，本周的分析结论已在上面）": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n（%@，本週的分析結論已在上面）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(%@, this week's analysis conclusions are above)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n（本周计划的结构化版暂时没有生成成功，以上是分析结论，稍后可再试一次）": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n（本週計劃的結構化版暫時沒有生成成功，以上是分析結論，稍後可再試一次）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(The structured version of this week's plan could not be generated at the moment. The above is the analysis conclusion. You can try again later.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
