    "「%@」": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」下的 %lld 条想法将回到未归类；AI 90 天内不会再归纳出该主题": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」下的 %lld 條想法將回到未歸類；AI 90 天內不會再歸納出該主題"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %lld thoughts under “%@” will return to Uncategorized; AI will not cluster this topic again for 90 days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不要的原因？": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」不要的原因？"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Why don't you want “%@”?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」及聊天里的提问和回答都会删除，此操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」及聊天裡的提問和回答都會刪除，此操作不可撤銷。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” and the questions and answers in the chat will be deleted. This action cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」拖了 %lld 天": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」拖了 %lld 天"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has been delayed %lld days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是测量类习惯（每日取最新值），做累计源会把每天的值加总": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」是測量類習慣（每日取最新值），做累計源會把每天的值加總"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is a measurement habit (takes the latest value each day). Using it as a cumulative source will sum up daily values."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是计数类习惯（当日累加），做达标源只取最新一条记录值": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」是計數類習慣（當日累加），做達標源只取最新一條記錄值"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is a counting habit (accumulates within the day). Using it as a goal source only takes the latest record value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的事件已改为跨天，超出任务时间块范围，已解除同步": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的事件已改為跨天，超出任務時間塊範圍，已解除同步"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The event for “%@” has been changed to span multiple days, exceeding the task time block range. Sync has been disconnected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的打卡提醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的打卡提醒"
