    "一条通知回顾上周完成了几件事、打卡了几天，点开直达今日看板；上周没有任何记录时保持安静。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一條通知回顧上週完成了幾件事、打卡了幾天，點開直達今日看板；上週沒有任何記錄時保持安靜。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A notification summarizing how many tasks you completed and how many days you checked in last week, tapping it takes you to Today Dashboard; stays silent if there were no records last week."
          }
        }
      }
    },
