    },
    "不用一次性盯住所有指标。等哪一项出现明显变化，这里会第一时间告诉你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用一次性盯住所有指標。等哪一項出現明顯變化，這裡會第一時間告訴你。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No need to watch all metrics at once. When one shows a significant change, you'll be the first to know here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用先找入口，直接告诉 Holo 发生了什么。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用先找入口，直接告訴 Holo 發生了什麼。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No need to find an entry point—just tell Holo what happened."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用想“该去哪记”——直接告诉 Holo 一件事，比如“午饭花了 35 元”，它会帮你记好。右边是记忆长廊，你的记录会自动汇成那里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用想“該去哪記”——直接告訴 Holo 一件事，比如“午飯花了 35 元”，它會幫你記好。右邊是記憶長廊，你的記錄會自動匯成那裡。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don't worry about where to record—just tell Holo something like 'Lunch cost ¥35' and it will log it for you. On the right is Memory Gallery, where your records automatically gather."
          }
        }
      }
    },
