    "与「删除账号」的区别：清空所有数据不注销账号，登录状态、Holo Plus 订阅与偏好设置都会保留；健康数据来自系统健康 App，不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "與「刪除帳號」的區別：清空所有資料不登出帳號，登入狀態、Holo Plus 訂閱與偏好設定都會保留；健康資料來自系統健康 App，不受影響。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Difference from 'Delete Account': clears all data without logging out; login status, Holo Plus subscription, and preferences are kept; health data comes from the system Health app and is unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
