    "为了让你锁屏、离开 App 后分析和回放也能完成，Holo 会把本次所需的数据（如任务、账目、习惯、想法记录）**加密上传到云端**完成处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為了讓你鎖屏、離開 App 後分析和回放也能完成，Holo 會把本次所需的資料（如任務、帳目、習慣、想法記錄）**加密上傳到雲端**完成處理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To let analysis and Replays finish even when your screen is locked or you leave the app, Holo **encrypts and uploads** the required data (such as Tasks, expenses, Habits, and Thought records) to the cloud for processing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
