    "你的 QQ 号": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 QQ 號"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your QQ number"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的个人数据助理。先来认识一下吧——": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的個人資料助理。先來認識一下吧——"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your personal data assistant. Let's get acquainted—"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的个人数据助理。帮你记录生活、安排事情，并慢慢看见自己的变化。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的個人資料助理。幫你記錄生活、安排事情，並慢慢看見自己的變化。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your personal data assistant. It helps you log life, organize things, and gradually see your own changes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的每条记录都会自动汇到这里，按日、周、月回看生活；右侧「洞察」是 Holo 对你的理解档案。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的每條記錄都會自動匯到這裡，按日、周、月回看生活；右側「洞察」是 Holo 對你的理解檔案。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All your records automatically gather here—review life by day, week, or month. On the right, \"Insight\" is Holo's profile of you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你睡眠接近目标时，第二天任务完成率通常更稳定。今晚优先保住睡眠环。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你睡眠接近目標時，第二天任務完成率通常更穩定。今晚優先保住睡眠環。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When your sleep is close to target, next-day task completion tends to be steadier. Prioritize closing your sleep ring tonight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你觉得哪里有问题？": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你覺得哪裡有問題？"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where do you see a problem?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你还可以继续问": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你還可以繼續問"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can keep asking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你还未开启 AI 数据处理授权\n开启后即可使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你還未開啟 AI 資料處理授權\n開啟後即可使用"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You haven't enabled AI data processing authorization\nEnable it to use this"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 AI 识别（银行账单认列、科目匹配）时，只发送：账单表头、脱敏后的几行样本（金额已替换为假数字、卡号打码）、去重后的交易对方名称、您的账户与科目名称清单。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 AI 識別（銀行帳單認列、科目匹配）時，只傳送：帳單表頭、脫敏後的幾行樣本（金額已替換為假數字、卡號打碼）、去重後的交易對方名稱、您的帳戶與科目名稱清單。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When using AI recognition (bank bill classification, category matching), only the following is sent: bill headers, a few anonymized sample rows (amounts replaced with fake numbers, card numbers masked), deduplicated counterparty names, and your account and category name lists."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用手机密码解锁": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用手機密碼解鎖"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Phone Passcode to Unlock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用真实 Query Service 与 Holo AI 开关，但不调用大模型、不修改记忆。问题正文和上下文只保留在当前临时页面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用真實 Query Service 與 Holo AI 開關，但不呼叫大模型、不修改記憶。問題正文和上下文只保留在當前臨時頁面。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the real Query Service and Holo AI toggle, but doesn't call the LLM or modify memory. Question text and context stay only on this temporary page."
