    "关闭后新想法不再自动请求 AI，但历史标签不受影响；你仍可对单条想法点「重新整理」，或在想法列表手动批量整理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉後新想法不再自動請求 AI，但歷史標籤不受影響；你仍可對單條想法點「重新整理」，或在想法列表手動批次整理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once disabled, new thoughts will no longer automatically request AI, but historical tags remain unaffected. You can still tap \"Reorganize\" on individual thoughts or manually batch-organize in the thought list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后的影响": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉後的影響"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impact of Disabling"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，HoloAI 对话、AI 洞察、自动整理和语音转文字将停止调用外部 AI/语音服务；本地记录、查看和删除数据不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉後，HoloAI 對話、AI 洞察、自動整理和語音轉文字將停止呼叫外部 AI/語音服務；本地記錄、檢視和刪除資料不受影響。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once disabled, HoloAI chat, AI Insights, auto-organization, and speech-to-text will stop using external AI/voice services. Local recording, viewing, and deletion remain unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭开关不会删除已有记忆，你仍可随时查看或管理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
