            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只代表最近一段时间，后续记录变化后会较快淡出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只代表最近一段時間，後續記錄變化後會較快淡出。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only represents recent activity and will fade quickly as records change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会删除当前这条记忆。如果之后出现新的证据，Holo 仍可能重新形成相似记忆。你的原始业务数据不会被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只會刪除當前這條記憶。如果之後出現新的證據，Holo 仍可能重新形成相似記憶。你的原始業務資料不會被刪除。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This only deletes this Memory. If new evidence appears later, Holo may form a similar Memory again. Your original business data will not be deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在你使用相关 AI 功能，或主动开启自动形成记忆后处理必要数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只在你使用相關 AI 功能，或主動開啟自動形成記憶後處理必要資料。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necessary data is processed only when you use related AI features or when you enable automatic Memory formation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有开启的主题会进入 HoloAI 的分类约束；历史主题默认关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有開啟的主題會進入 HoloAI 的分類約束；歷史主題預設關閉。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only enabled Topics are used as classification constraints in HoloAI; historical Topics are off by default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有打卡型习惯能设提醒，数值型不参与": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有打卡型習慣能設提醒，數值型不參與"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only check-in Habits can set reminders; numeric ones are not included"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读仓库快照：不发网络请求，不写仓库": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只讀倉庫快照：不髮網路請求，不寫倉庫"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only repository snapshot: no network requests, no writes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读同步 · 步数 / 睡眠 / 站立": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只讀同步 · 步數 / 睡眠 / 站立"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only sync · Steps / Sleep / Stand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以先切回对话继续聊，完成时「报告」会亮红点": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以先切回對話繼續聊，完成時「報告」會亮紅點"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can switch back to Chat and continue; the Report will show a red dot when done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以先选几个方向，也可以直接跳过——主题会从你的想法里长出来，Holo 攒够同类想法后会建议你建立主题。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以先選幾個方向，也可以直接跳過——主題會從你的想法裡長出來，Holo 攢夠同類想法後會建議你建立主題。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can pick a few directions or skip—Topics will grow from your Thoughts. Holo will suggest creating a Topic once enough similar Thoughts accumulate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以离开当前页面；系统支持时会继续处理，中止后会保留进度并在回到 App 后恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以離開當前頁面；系統支援時會繼續處理，中止後會保留進度並在回到 App 後恢復。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can leave this page; processing continues when the system allows. If interrupted, progress is saved and resumes when you return to the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
