          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "後臺序列整理，受每日配額限制，會佔用今日 AI 額度（與聊天等共享，可能影響新想法當天的自動整理）；多餘條目會在後續開啟 App 時自動續做。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Background processing runs sequentially and is subject to the daily quota. It uses today's AI quota (shared with chat, etc., which may affect automatic organization of new thoughts on the same day). Extra items will automatically continue the next time you open the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
