        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld items will be restored to their original module."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将扫描 AI 创建的交易，按「AI 原始猜测 → 你最终确认的分类」重建映射。已存在的映射不会被覆盖。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將掃描 AI 建立的交易，按「AI 原始猜測 → 你最終確認的分類」重建對映。已存在的對映不會被覆蓋。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will scan AI-created transactions and rebuild mappings based on \"AI's original guess → your final confirmed category.\" Existing mappings will not be overwritten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
