    "影子=计算并记录但不影响分类；注入=语义近邻标签进入分类候选。评估样本用于人工标注候选池覆盖率（Gate：提升 ≥10pp 才开注入）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影子=計算並記錄但不影響分類；注入=語義近鄰標籤進入分類候選。評估樣本用於人工標註候選池覆蓋率（Gate：提升 ≥10pp 才開注入）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shadow = calculate and record but do not affect classification; Injection = semantic neighbor tags enter classification candidates. Evaluation samples are used for manual annotation of candidate pool coverage (Gate: enable injection only when improvement is ≥10pp)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
