    "无法在 App 内解压该压缩包。\n微信/支付宝导出的账单是加密压缩包（解压密码在对应 App 里显示），请先在电脑上解压，再把解压出来的 CSV/XLSX 文件导入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法在 App 內解壓該壓縮包。\n微信/支付寶匯出的帳單是加密壓縮包（解壓密碼在對應 App 裡顯示），請先在電腦上解壓，再把解壓出來的 CSV/XLSX 檔案匯入。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to unzip this archive in the app.\nBills exported from WeChat/Alipay are encrypted archives (the password is shown in the corresponding app). Please unzip on your computer first, then import the extracted CSV/XLSX files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
