      }
    },
    "此处用于内部调试 Agent 子系统。Feature Flag 开启后才会读取真实数据并调用后端 agent_loop；默认 mock 不产生真实结论。诊断快照只含技术元数据，不导出问题、对话、金额、健康指标或证据正文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此處用於內部除錯 Agent 子系統。Feature Flag 開啟後才會讀取真實資料並呼叫後端 agent_loop；預設 mock 不產生真實結論。診斷快照只含技術後設資料，不匯出問題、對話、金額、健康指標或證據正文。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For internal debugging of the Agent subsystem. Real data is read and backend agent_loop is called only when the Feature Flag is enabled; by default, mock produces no real conclusions. Diagnostic snapshots contain only technical metadata and do not export questions, conversations, amounts, health metrics, or evidence content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
