            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目標快到截止、或停了兩週沒動靜時，HoloAI 會主動提醒你。開關在每個目標的詳情頁（「允許 HoloAI 主動圍繞此目標提醒」），按目標單獨控制。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HoloAI will proactively remind you when a goal is nearing its deadline or has been inactive for two weeks. The toggle is on each goal's detail page (\"Allow HoloAI to proactively remind about this goal\"), controlled per goal."
          }
