          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会删除本机 Holo 数据、附件、AI 记忆、缓存和登录状态。已同步到 iCloud 的 Holo 数据会在系统同步后尝试删除；如果设备离线，删除同步可能延后。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會刪除本機 Holo 資料、附件、AI 記憶、快取和登入狀態。已同步到 iCloud 的 Holo 資料會在系統同步後嘗試刪除；如果裝置離線，刪除同步可能延後。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete Holo data, attachments, AI memories, cache, and login status on this device. Holo data synced to iCloud will be attempted for deletion after system sync; if the device is offline, deletion sync may be delayed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这几个信号像是一起偏紧，先不用过度解读。": {
