    "这是个什么日子？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What kind of day is this?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是個什麼日子？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是你在对话里明确表达过的内容，Holo 据此形成了这条记忆。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是你在對話裡明確表達過的內容，Holo 據此形成了這條記憶。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is what you explicitly expressed in the conversation, and Holo formed this memory based on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是明确的重要事实；除非你纠正或删除，否则会长期保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是明確的重要事實；除非你糾正或刪除，否則會長期保留。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an explicitly important fact; it will be kept long-term unless you correct or delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这条想法还没有形成稳定方向，可以先放着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這條想法還沒有形成穩定方向，可以先放著。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This thought hasn't formed a stable direction yet, so you can leave it for now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
