            "value": "This generation wasn't completed. You can continue generating."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次综合分析提炼了几个跨模块的变化和提醒。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這次綜合分析提煉了幾個跨模組的變化和提醒。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This comprehensive analysis extracted several cross-module changes and reminders."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次追问没能完成，可能是网络中断。点「重试」原样再问一次，不消耗额外额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這次追問沒能完成，可能是網路中斷。點「重試」原樣再問一次，不消耗額外額度。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This follow-up couldn't be completed, possibly due to a network interruption. Tap \"Retry\" to ask the same question again without consuming extra quota."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这段时间的习惯表现可以从完成率、活跃习惯和连续记录里看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這段時間的習慣表現可以從完成率、活躍習慣和連續記錄裡看。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Habit performance during this period can be seen from completion rate, active habits, and streak records."
          }
        }
