      }
    },
    "这段正文不会写入 Trace；离开页面后即释放。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這段正文不會寫入 Trace；離開頁面後即釋放。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This text won't be written to Trace; it will be released after leaving the page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里会切换服务端真实权益与独立验收额度。\"跟随购买\"会恢复账号的真实购买状态，不会被验收数据覆盖。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡會切換服務端真實權益與獨立驗收額度。\"跟隨購買\"會恢復帳號的真實購買狀態，不會被驗收資料覆蓋。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This toggles between real server-side benefits and independent acceptance quota. \"Follow Purchase\" will restore the account's real purchase status and won't be overwritten by acceptance data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里只保存数量、阶段和拒绝代码，不保存模型原文、记忆正文或证据摘要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡只儲存數量、階段和拒絕程式碼，不儲存模型原文、記憶正文或證據摘要。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only counts, stages, and refusal codes are saved here; model text, memory content, and evidence summaries are not saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里同时展示通过与未通过组合，便于验证为什么没有形成跨域记忆。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡同時展示透過與未透過組合，便於驗證為什麼沒有形成跨域記憶。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both passed and failed combinations are shown here to help verify why no cross-domain memory was formed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里有几条值得关注的变化。": {
      "localizations": {
